    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247000,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "reasons we will get into soon. The point for now \nis that by the time this shopping spree wrapped  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251520,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "up, Microsoft's gaming division alone stood at \n22,000 people as they started struggling with  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257080,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "returns and questions from their corporate \noverlords. They also followed the same model  "
