  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305800,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "assuming regulators actually let it close, \nwhich uh [music] well, they probably will.  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310320,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "More acquisitions have also furthered the trend \nof layoffs as a lot of the time these companies  "
