      "utf8": "will come up mindset would work here as well. In \nhindsight, it clearly hasn't worked out. But well,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 345920,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why were they wrong? Well, a few reasons. The \nfirst is that a lot of gamers aren't actually  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351400,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "gamers. They are just people who happen to play \na video game, which might sound like the world's  "
    } ]
  }, {
