  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384840,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "titles and players kept going up, the number \nof games people actually spend their time in  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388960,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "went down. While making this video, I looked back \nthrough my old binder, and there were at least 20  "
